# Swift

Prefer:
- value types (struct)
- immutability
- async/await
- Result types for error handling

Avoid:
- force unwraps
- force casts
- large UIViewControllers

Prefer dependency injection for services.

## Navigation

Prefer SourceKit-LSP and symbol-based tools over text search: go to definition,
find references, symbol search. Use text search only for comments, strings, and
config files.

Check references across modules before refactoring a function.
